{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -230,
      "width": 1040,
      "height": 110,
      "text": "# Gantry + vision roadmap\nBuild → train → evaluate → validate on owned devices."
    },
    {
      "id": "gantry-group",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -30,
      "y": -65,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 970,
      "label": "Gantry build",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "vision-group",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 570,
      "y": -65,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 970,
      "label": "Vision model build + training",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "gantry-1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## 1 · Build the gantry\nFrame, rails, motors, phone mount and stylus.\nCheck fit, travel and wiring."
    },
    {
      "id": "gantry-2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 230,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## 2 · Controller + safety\nStart with a fake controller.\nAdd homing, travel limits, acknowledgements and emergency stop."
    },
    {
      "id": "gantry-3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 460,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## 3 · Camera + calibration\nMount the camera and map image pixels to gantry coordinates.\nVerify held-out points and safe tap / drag paths."
    },
    {
      "id": "gantry-4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 690,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## 4 · Supervised bring-up\nTest unloaded motion, then an owned phone.\nRequire hardware, calibration and safety checks before physical contact."
    },
    {
      "id": "vision-1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 600,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## 1 · Build tasks + capture data\nUse the owned benchmark site.\nCapture varied layouts, fonts, devices and task states."
    },
    {
      "id": "vision-2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 600,
      "y": 230,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## 2 · Label + split\nLabel UI targets and OCR text.\nKeep layout / device groups separate; audit duplicates before training."
    },
    {
      "id": "vision-3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 600,
      "y": 460,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## 3 · Train detector + OCR pipeline\nEstablish a CPU baseline and train a small YOLO detector.\nTune for the GTX 1080’s 8 GB when that hardware is available."
    },
    {
      "id": "vision-4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 600,
      "y": 690,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## 4 · Evaluate + export\nMeasure target hits, OCR errors and latency.\nCompare exported outputs; reserve unseen real-phone data for final validation."
    },
    {
      "id": "integration",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 280,
      "y": 980,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## 5 · Connect vision to gantry\nPixels → typed intentions → safety checks → controller.\nReplay safely with the fake controller before supervised hardware runs."
    },
    {
      "id": "validation",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 280,
      "y": 1240,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## 6 · Validate end to end\nLet the owned site independently score task outcomes.\nCheck accessibility, wrong actions and timing; record failures before the next iteration."
    }
  ],
